	"data": "Steam Frame + Valve's Reputation Moat\n\nType: Market Analysis\nStatus: Discussion + research\nDate: 2026-09-04\n\nCore Idea\nValve's Steam Frame (upcoming standalone VR headset) has a structural advantage beyond hardware specs: Valve's reputation for player-respecting, open hardware and software. There's a large audience of PC gamers who want VR but refuse to buy Meta on principle. The Steam Frame releases that pent-up demand.\n\nValve's Reputation Moat\nProton/Steam Deck: Invested years into making…",
